      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Société française d\u2019anesthésie et de réanimation (Sfar). Published by Elsevier SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "In patients with neuromuscular diseases, the use of rocuronium in the general anesthesia rapid sequence induction provides safety intubation conditions, but induces a deep and prolonged neuromuscular blockade. We report dose reduction to 0.8mg/kg for a 47-year-old female with Landouzy-Dejerine myopathy. Therefore, less dose of sugammadex was given to reverse the neuromuscular block."
      },
